  ],
  "duration_s": 372.68,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "爸爸为什么富人越来越富，穷人想翻身却难如登天？因为同样一百块钱放在不同的人手里，作用完全不一样。钱还有什么不一样？当然对一个人来说，他是种子。对另一个人来说，他可能只是今天的饭钱，难道穷人就永远翻不了身吗？我带你去看一个人，看完以后，你自己回答，请进经理，我在公司楼下，商业街租了间店铺好地方地方是好，可我不知道卖什么租金，交了吗？交了一年，那先别开店，那我干嘛把铺子往外租，我是来问开什么店，不是问怎么租出去，谁让你真租了贴张告示旺铺转租有人来看店铺，就问他他做什么生意，做了多少年，准备做什么生意？茶叶卖鞋，开酒馆、做服装，我做衣服的服装店也是衣服经理，三十多波人，光卖衣服的就十二家，这地方衣服最好卖，我明天就进衣服。别着急，十二家都看好，这里肯定能挣钱。你看见十二家卖衣服的，觉得衣服好卖，我看见的是十二个，还没开门的对手。我问你那十二个人手里有衣服吗？当然有懂衣服吗？肯定比我懂有货又懂衣服，那你为什么还自己进货？把那十二个做衣服的全叫回来，告诉他们店铺不租了，每家拿二十款衣服放你这儿卖，他们能愿意他们自己开店铺，要交租金吧，要要装修吧，要要雇员工吧，也要现在呢衣服卖出去，你才拿一份钱，卖不出去，原样拿走，换别的款换成你，你来不来在的。刚才哎太难了，拜拜为什么？然后真卖起来了，哪家的衣服好卖，一眼就看出来，那就更简单了。卖的好的多给好位置，卖不动的少摆，连续几天没人要换下一家，合着我，更不用猜哪款好卖，你猜他干什么，顾客自然会替你挑。可十二家挤在一个店铺里，不乱吗？乱才好，谁卖贵了，顾客买别家的，谁家的衣服差了好位置让给别人，你要自己卖衣服，得进货，压资金、赌款式。现在呢十二家给你供货，顾客替你挑货，我只从卖出去的衣服里拿钱，差点把十二个做服装的全变成我的对手。做买卖啊，看见同行多，别光想着怎么打败他，先琢磨琢磨能不能让他给你干活儿怎么样。现在能回答刚才的问题了吗？我好像明白了，说说看，同样是租了一间铺子，他想到的是自己花钱进货，你想到的却让十二个卖衣服的人给他供货，再让顾客帮他挑出什么最好卖。还有呢他原来看到的是十二个竞争对手，换个角度就变成了十二个可以合作的人。所以同样的钱，同样的店铺，最后的结果可能完全不一样。现在明白我为什么说同样一百块钱在不同的人手里作用完全不一样了吗？明白了，可是爸爸这些东西你都是从哪学来的？哪有人天生就会做生意，很多东西都是一点一点学出来的。浙商思维。嗯，你看这一句，别人扎堆，我收手，别人观望，我入局，刚才十二个人都准备开服装店。如果别人卖什么，你就跟着卖什么，那不叫发现机会，那就要跟着别人挤一条路。再看这一句，大胆入局，绝不赌上全部身家。普通人本钱本来就不多，更不能还没看懂市场，就把全部积蓄压进去先试再做，跑得通，在家跑不通，还能回头。就像刚才让他先天旺铺转租。对，先让市场告诉你这里到底适合卖什么。还有这一句同行不是敌人，是共赢伙伴。刚才那个职员看见十二个卖衣服的，想到的是竞争，换一个角度，十二个竞争对手就变成了十二个供货商。所以这里还有一句，信息渠道共享，机遇互利共生，别人有货，懂衣服，他有店铺、有客流，不是所有生意都要自己从头做到尾。有时候真正重要的是把别人已经有的资源重新组合起来，那只要会整合资源，就一定能赚钱吗？当然不是你。再看这一句，稳住风险底线比拼命赚钱更重要。会赚钱是能力，会守钱才是本事，尤其是普通人本钱越少，越不能拿全部家电去赌一次机会。还有这一句拒绝虚胖，规模，落袋才是真利润。开多大的店，进多少货，都不代表你真正赚到了钱货堆在仓库里，那不是利润，那是被压住的钱，真正能留下来的才是自己的。现在你再回答我，为什么同样一百块钱放在不同的人手里，作用会完全不一样？因为有的人只看到一百块钱能买什么，有的人却会想怎么利用它，怎么借力，怎么控制风险，再让它慢慢变成更多的钱。还有逆向思维、试错思维，抱观思维、资源整合、现金流和风险控制。别人看见同行，只想着怎么竞争，有人却会想怎么合作。别人一做生意就想着压货扩店，有人先想的是怎么把风险降下来，那普通人还有机会吗？当然有，只是本钱越少，越不能靠赌，要靠判断、靠积累、靠借力，更要学会控制风险。这本浙商思维里讲的不只是怎么赚钱，真正值得学的不是哪一个所谓的发财绝招，而是遇到同样一件事的时候，你能不能换一个角度去看。所以你刚才说的种子其实不只是钱。对，钱是种子，但真正决定这颗种子，最后能不能长大的是一个人看问题、做选择的方式，我明白了，明白了就慢慢学。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00001",
      "start_ms": 170,
      "end_ms": 2370,
      "text": "爸爸为什么富人越来越富，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00002",
      "start_ms": 2610,
      "end_ms": 4470,
      "text": "穷人想翻身却难如登天？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00003",
      "start_ms": 5090,
      "end_ms": 7810,
      "text": "因为同样一百块钱放在不同的人手里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00004",
      "start_ms": 8029,
      "end_ms": 9190,
      "text": "作用完全不一样。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00005",
      "start_ms": 9630,
      "end_ms": 10990,
      "text": "钱还有什么不一样？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00006",
      "start_ms": 11090,
      "end_ms": 12830,
      "text": "当然对一个人来说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00007",
      "start_ms": 13010,
      "end_ms": 13730,
      "text": "他是种子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00008",
      "start_ms": 13930,
      "end_ms": 14870,
      "text": "对另一个人来说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00009",
      "start_ms": 14950,
      "end_ms": 16190,
      "text": "他可能只是今天的饭钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00010",
      "start_ms": 17410,
      "end_ms": 19410,
      "text": "难道穷人就永远翻不了身吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00011",
      "start_ms": 21110,
      "end_ms": 22250,
      "text": "我带你去看一个人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00012",
      "start_ms": 22790,
      "end_ms": 23310,
      "text": "看完以后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00013",
      "start_ms": 23310,
      "end_ms": 24055,
      "text": "你自己回答，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00014",
      "start_ms": 27760,
      "end_ms": 30580,
      "text": "请进经理，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00015",
      "start_ms": 30840,
      "end_ms": 31660,
      "text": "我在公司楼下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00016",
      "start_ms": 31660,
      "end_ms": 35960,
      "text": "商业街租了间店铺好地方地方是好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00017",
      "start_ms": 36260,
      "end_ms": 37820,
      "text": "可我不知道卖什么租金，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00018",
      "start_ms": 37820,
      "end_ms": 38340,
      "text": "交了吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00019",
      "start_ms": 38560,
      "end_ms": 39240,
      "text": "交了一年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00020",
      "start_ms": 39520,
      "end_ms": 40320,
      "text": "那先别开店，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00021",
      "start_ms": 41940,
      "end_ms": 44320,
      "text": "那我干嘛把铺子往外租，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00022",
      "start_ms": 45460,
      "end_ms": 46900,
      "text": "我是来问开什么店，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00023",
      "start_ms": 46920,
      "end_ms": 48160,
      "text": "不是问怎么租出去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00024",
      "start_ms": 49440,
      "end_ms": 55880,
      "text": "谁让你真租了贴张告示旺铺转租有人来看店铺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00025",
      "start_ms": 56180,
      "end_ms": 58330,
      "text": "就问他他做什么生意，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00026",
      "start_ms": 58550,
      "end_ms": 59330,
      "text": "做了多少年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00027",
      "start_ms": 59610,
      "end_ms": 60625,
      "text": "准备做什么生意？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00028",
      "start_ms": 60930,
      "end_ms": 63155,
      "text": "茶叶卖鞋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00029",
      "start_ms": 64680,
      "end_ms": 67915,
      "text": "开酒馆、做服装，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00030",
      "start_ms": 68430,
      "end_ms": 75265,
      "text": "我做衣服的服装店也是衣服经理，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00031",
      "start_ms": 75750,
      "end_ms": 76590,
      "text": "三十多波人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00032",
      "start_ms": 76770,
      "end_ms": 78195,
      "text": "光卖衣服的就十二家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00033",
      "start_ms": 78560,
      "end_ms": 79600,
      "text": "这地方衣服最好卖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00034",
      "start_ms": 79680,
      "end_ms": 80725,
      "text": "我明天就进衣服。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00035",
      "start_ms": 81220,
      "end_ms": 81765,
      "text": "别着急，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00036",
      "start_ms": 82360,
      "end_ms": 83180,
      "text": "十二家都看好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00037",
      "start_ms": 83180,
      "end_ms": 84360,
      "text": "这里肯定能挣钱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00038",
      "start_ms": 84580,
      "end_ms": 86165,
      "text": "你看见十二家卖衣服的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00039",
      "start_ms": 86350,
      "end_ms": 87235,
      "text": "觉得衣服好卖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00040",
      "start_ms": 87550,
      "end_ms": 88650,
      "text": "我看见的是十二个，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00041",
      "start_ms": 88650,
      "end_ms": 89835,
      "text": "还没开门的对手。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00042",
      "start_ms": 90090,
      "end_ms": 92940,
      "text": "我问你那十二个人手里有衣服吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00043",
      "start_ms": 92980,
      "end_ms": 94485,
      "text": "当然有懂衣服吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00044",
      "start_ms": 94860,
      "end_ms": 97565,
      "text": "肯定比我懂有货又懂衣服，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00045",
      "start_ms": 97910,
      "end_ms": 99315,
      "text": "那你为什么还自己进货？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00046",
      "start_ms": 99730,
      "end_ms": 101565,
      "text": "把那十二个做衣服的全叫回来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00047",
      "start_ms": 102110,
      "end_ms": 103635,
      "text": "告诉他们店铺不租了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00048",
      "start_ms": 104010,
      "end_ms": 105605,
      "text": "每家拿二十款衣服放你这儿卖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00049",
      "start_ms": 105980,
      "end_ms": 108360,
      "text": "他们能愿意他们自己开店铺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00050",
      "start_ms": 108700,
      "end_ms": 109595,
      "text": "要交租金吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00051",
      "start_ms": 109920,
      "end_ms": 111380,
      "text": "要要装修吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00052",
      "start_ms": 111480,
      "end_ms": 112780,
      "text": "要要雇员工吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00053",
      "start_ms": 112980,
      "end_ms": 115805,
      "text": "也要现在呢衣服卖出去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00054",
      "start_ms": 116100,
      "end_ms": 117035,
      "text": "你才拿一份钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00055",
      "start_ms": 117690,
      "end_ms": 118350,
      "text": "卖不出去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00056",
      "start_ms": 118550,
      "end_ms": 119230,
      "text": "原样拿走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00057",
      "start_ms": 119250,
      "end_ms": 121030,
      "text": "换别的款换成你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00058",
      "start_ms": 121170,
      "end_ms": 127770,
      "text": "你来不来在的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00059",
      "start_ms": 127770,
      "end_ms": 130275,
      "text": "刚才哎太难了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00060",
      "start_ms": 131690,
      "end_ms": 138360,
      "text": "拜拜为什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00061",
      "start_ms": 138420,
      "end_ms": 139730,
      "text": "然后真卖起来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00062",
      "start_ms": 139730,
      "end_ms": 140710,
      "text": "哪家的衣服好卖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00063",
      "start_ms": 140730,
      "end_ms": 141675,
      "text": "一眼就看出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00064",
      "start_ms": 141910,
      "end_ms": 142895,
      "text": "那就更简单了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00065",
      "start_ms": 143330,
      "end_ms": 144905,
      "text": "卖的好的多给好位置，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00066",
      "start_ms": 145110,
      "end_ms": 146345,
      "text": "卖不动的少摆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00067",
      "start_ms": 146700,
      "end_ms": 148605,
      "text": "连续几天没人要换下一家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00068",
      "start_ms": 148880,
      "end_ms": 149240,
      "text": "合着我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00069",
      "start_ms": 149240,
      "end_ms": 150415,
      "text": "更不用猜哪款好卖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00070",
      "start_ms": 150940,
      "end_ms": 151860,
      "text": "你猜他干什么，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00071",
      "start_ms": 152000,
      "end_ms": 153420,
      "text": "顾客自然会替你挑。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00072",
      "start_ms": 153740,
      "end_ms": 155260,
      "text": "可十二家挤在一个店铺里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00073",
      "start_ms": 155260,
      "end_ms": 155860,
      "text": "不乱吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00074",
      "start_ms": 156080,
      "end_ms": 156740,
      "text": "乱才好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00075",
      "start_ms": 156920,
      "end_ms": 157680,
      "text": "谁卖贵了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00076",
      "start_ms": 157680,
      "end_ms": 158660,
      "text": "顾客买别家的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00077",
      "start_ms": 158740,
      "end_ms": 160915,
      "text": "谁家的衣服差了好位置让给别人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00078",
      "start_ms": 161180,
      "end_ms": 162220,
      "text": "你要自己卖衣服，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00079",
      "start_ms": 162340,
      "end_ms": 162920,
      "text": "得进货，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00080",
      "start_ms": 162920,
      "end_ms": 164215,
      "text": "压资金、赌款式。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00081",
      "start_ms": 164630,
      "end_ms": 166430,
      "text": "现在呢十二家给你供货，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00082",
      "start_ms": 166590,
      "end_ms": 167610,
      "text": "顾客替你挑货，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00083",
      "start_ms": 167810,
      "end_ms": 169595,
      "text": "我只从卖出去的衣服里拿钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00084",
      "start_ms": 169980,
      "end_ms": 172460,
      "text": "差点把十二个做服装的全变成我的对手。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00085",
      "start_ms": 172580,
      "end_ms": 173340,
      "text": "做买卖啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00086",
      "start_ms": 173460,
      "end_ms": 174300,
      "text": "看见同行多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00087",
      "start_ms": 174460,
      "end_ms": 175715,
      "text": "别光想着怎么打败他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00088",
      "start_ms": 176270,
      "end_ms": 184310,
      "text": "先琢磨琢磨能不能让他给你干活儿怎么样。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00089",
      "start_ms": 185130,
      "end_ms": 186850,
      "text": "现在能回答刚才的问题了吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00090",
      "start_ms": 187190,
      "end_ms": 188410,
      "text": "我好像明白了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00091",
      "start_ms": 189070,
      "end_ms": 189670,
      "text": "说说看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00092",
      "start_ms": 189890,
      "end_ms": 191230,
      "text": "同样是租了一间铺子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00093",
      "start_ms": 191450,
      "end_ms": 193130,
      "text": "他想到的是自己花钱进货，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00094",
      "start_ms": 193370,
      "end_ms": 195770,
      "text": "你想到的却让十二个卖衣服的人给他供货，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00095",
      "start_ms": 196010,
      "end_ms": 197810,
      "text": "再让顾客帮他挑出什么最好卖。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00096",
      "start_ms": 198310,
      "end_ms": 201870,
      "text": "还有呢他原来看到的是十二个竞争对手，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00097",
      "start_ms": 202290,
      "end_ms": 204870,
      "text": "换个角度就变成了十二个可以合作的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00098",
      "start_ms": 204970,
      "end_ms": 205950,
      "text": "所以同样的钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00099",
      "start_ms": 206170,
      "end_ms": 206950,
      "text": "同样的店铺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00100",
      "start_ms": 207170,
      "end_ms": 209050,
      "text": "最后的结果可能完全不一样。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00101",
      "start_ms": 209570,
      "end_ms": 214940,
      "text": "现在明白我为什么说同样一百块钱在不同的人手里作用完全不一样了吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00102",
      "start_ms": 215000,
      "end_ms": 215660,
      "text": "明白了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00103",
      "start_ms": 215960,
      "end_ms": 218920,
      "text": "可是爸爸这些东西你都是从哪学来的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00104",
      "start_ms": 219800,
      "end_ms": 221440,
      "text": "哪有人天生就会做生意，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00105",
      "start_ms": 222680,
      "end_ms": 225465,
      "text": "很多东西都是一点一点学出来的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00106",
      "start_ms": 228260,
      "end_ms": 229340,
      "text": "浙商思维。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00107",
      "start_ms": 229640,
      "end_ms": 229955,
      "text": "嗯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00108",
      "start_ms": 232720,
      "end_ms": 233460,
      "text": "你看这一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00109",
      "start_ms": 233640,
      "end_ms": 234420,
      "text": "别人扎堆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00110",
      "start_ms": 234420,
      "end_ms": 234960,
      "text": "我收手，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00111",
      "start_ms": 235120,
      "end_ms": 235840,
      "text": "别人观望，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00112",
      "start_ms": 235860,
      "end_ms": 236440,
      "text": "我入局，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00113",
      "start_ms": 236700,
      "end_ms": 238820,
      "text": "刚才十二个人都准备开服装店。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00114",
      "start_ms": 239100,
      "end_ms": 240060,
      "text": "如果别人卖什么，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00115",
      "start_ms": 240060,
      "end_ms": 241165,
      "text": "你就跟着卖什么，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00116",
      "start_ms": 241400,
      "end_ms": 242565,
      "text": "那不叫发现机会，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00117",
      "start_ms": 242900,
      "end_ms": 244585,
      "text": "那就要跟着别人挤一条路。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00118",
      "start_ms": 245320,
      "end_ms": 246085,
      "text": "再看这一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00119",
      "start_ms": 246340,
      "end_ms": 247060,
      "text": "大胆入局，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00120",
      "start_ms": 247220,
      "end_ms": 248635,
      "text": "绝不赌上全部身家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00121",
      "start_ms": 249050,
      "end_ms": 250550,
      "text": "普通人本钱本来就不多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00122",
      "start_ms": 250690,
      "end_ms": 251970,
      "text": "更不能还没看懂市场，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00123",
      "start_ms": 251970,
      "end_ms": 254730,
      "text": "就把全部积蓄压进去先试再做，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00124",
      "start_ms": 255010,
      "end_ms": 255450,
      "text": "跑得通，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00125",
      "start_ms": 255450,
      "end_ms": 256510,
      "text": "在家跑不通，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00126",
      "start_ms": 256510,
      "end_ms": 257215,
      "text": "还能回头。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00127",
      "start_ms": 257480,
      "end_ms": 259240,
      "text": "就像刚才让他先天旺铺转租。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00128",
      "start_ms": 259460,
      "end_ms": 259700,
      "text": "对，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00129",
      "start_ms": 259960,
      "end_ms": 262340,
      "text": "先让市场告诉你这里到底适合卖什么。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00130",
      "start_ms": 262340,
      "end_ms": 264485,
      "text": "还有这一句同行不是敌人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00131",
      "start_ms": 264750,
      "end_ms": 265745,
      "text": "是共赢伙伴。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00132",
      "start_ms": 266070,
      "end_ms": 268210,
      "text": "刚才那个职员看见十二个卖衣服的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00133",
      "start_ms": 268250,
      "end_ms": 269210,
      "text": "想到的是竞争，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00134",
      "start_ms": 269470,
      "end_ms": 270315,
      "text": "换一个角度，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00135",
      "start_ms": 270680,
      "end_ms": 273300,
      "text": "十二个竞争对手就变成了十二个供货商。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00136",
      "start_ms": 273520,
      "end_ms": 274715,
      "text": "所以这里还有一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00137",
      "start_ms": 275030,
      "end_ms": 276310,
      "text": "信息渠道共享，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00138",
      "start_ms": 276490,
      "end_ms": 277550,
      "text": "机遇互利共生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00139",
      "start_ms": 277830,
      "end_ms": 278550,
      "text": "别人有货，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00140",
      "start_ms": 278610,
      "end_ms": 279130,
      "text": "懂衣服，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00141",
      "start_ms": 279130,
      "end_ms": 280355,
      "text": "他有店铺、有客流，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00142",
      "start_ms": 280700,
      "end_ms": 282595,
      "text": "不是所有生意都要自己从头做到尾。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00143",
      "start_ms": 282870,
      "end_ms": 287310,
      "text": "有时候真正重要的是把别人已经有的资源重新组合起来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00144",
      "start_ms": 287470,
      "end_ms": 288810,
      "text": "那只要会整合资源，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00145",
      "start_ms": 288810,
      "end_ms": 289810,
      "text": "就一定能赚钱吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00146",
      "start_ms": 289890,
      "end_ms": 291060,
      "text": "当然不是你。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00147",
      "start_ms": 291060,
      "end_ms": 291840,
      "text": "再看这一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00148",
      "start_ms": 291980,
      "end_ms": 294140,
      "text": "稳住风险底线比拼命赚钱更重要。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00149",
      "start_ms": 294220,
      "end_ms": 295320,
      "text": "会赚钱是能力，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00150",
      "start_ms": 295500,
      "end_ms": 296995,
      "text": "会守钱才是本事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00151",
      "start_ms": 297310,
      "end_ms": 299170,
      "text": "尤其是普通人本钱越少，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00152",
      "start_ms": 299370,
      "end_ms": 301345,
      "text": "越不能拿全部家电去赌一次机会。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00153",
      "start_ms": 301840,
      "end_ms": 303320,
      "text": "还有这一句拒绝虚胖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00154",
      "start_ms": 303340,
      "end_ms": 303740,
      "text": "规模，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00155",
      "start_ms": 303960,
      "end_ms": 305240,
      "text": "落袋才是真利润。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00156",
      "start_ms": 305320,
      "end_ms": 306140,
      "text": "开多大的店，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00157",
      "start_ms": 306160,
      "end_ms": 306860,
      "text": "进多少货，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00158",
      "start_ms": 307040,
      "end_ms": 309940,
      "text": "都不代表你真正赚到了钱货堆在仓库里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00159",
      "start_ms": 309940,
      "end_ms": 310740,
      "text": "那不是利润，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00160",
      "start_ms": 310860,
      "end_ms": 311940,
      "text": "那是被压住的钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00161",
      "start_ms": 312220,
      "end_ms": 314460,
      "text": "真正能留下来的才是自己的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00162",
      "start_ms": 314620,
      "end_ms": 315720,
      "text": "现在你再回答我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00163",
      "start_ms": 316440,
      "end_ms": 319120,
      "text": "为什么同样一百块钱放在不同的人手里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00164",
      "start_ms": 319140,
      "end_ms": 320380,
      "text": "作用会完全不一样？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00165",
      "start_ms": 320980,
      "end_ms": 323440,
      "text": "因为有的人只看到一百块钱能买什么，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00166",
      "start_ms": 323840,
      "end_ms": 325820,
      "text": "有的人却会想怎么利用它，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00167",
      "start_ms": 325880,
      "end_ms": 326500,
      "text": "怎么借力，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00168",
      "start_ms": 326500,
      "end_ms": 327380,
      "text": "怎么控制风险，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00169",
      "start_ms": 327680,
      "end_ms": 329360,
      "text": "再让它慢慢变成更多的钱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00170",
      "start_ms": 329560,
      "end_ms": 331180,
      "text": "还有逆向思维、试错思维，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00171",
      "start_ms": 331180,
      "end_ms": 334410,
      "text": "抱观思维、资源整合、现金流和风险控制。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00172",
      "start_ms": 334410,
      "end_ms": 335490,
      "text": "别人看见同行，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00173",
      "start_ms": 335490,
      "end_ms": 336410,
      "text": "只想着怎么竞争，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00174",
      "start_ms": 336490,
      "end_ms": 337770,
      "text": "有人却会想怎么合作。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00175",
      "start_ms": 338130,
      "end_ms": 340290,
      "text": "别人一做生意就想着压货扩店，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00176",
      "start_ms": 340510,
      "end_ms": 342630,
      "text": "有人先想的是怎么把风险降下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00177",
      "start_ms": 342630,
      "end_ms": 343990,
      "text": "那普通人还有机会吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00178",
      "start_ms": 344230,
      "end_ms": 344890,
      "text": "当然有，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00179",
      "start_ms": 345250,
      "end_ms": 346270,
      "text": "只是本钱越少，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00180",
      "start_ms": 346330,
      "end_ms": 347110,
      "text": "越不能靠赌，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00181",
      "start_ms": 347290,
      "end_ms": 349270,
      "text": "要靠判断、靠积累、靠借力，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00182",
      "start_ms": 349450,
      "end_ms": 350690,
      "text": "更要学会控制风险。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00183",
      "start_ms": 350850,
      "end_ms": 353450,
      "text": "这本浙商思维里讲的不只是怎么赚钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00184",
      "start_ms": 353550,
      "end_ms": 356430,
      "text": "真正值得学的不是哪一个所谓的发财绝招，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00185",
      "start_ms": 356590,
      "end_ms": 358290,
      "text": "而是遇到同样一件事的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00186",
      "start_ms": 358430,
      "end_ms": 359910,
      "text": "你能不能换一个角度去看。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00187",
      "start_ms": 359970,
      "end_ms": 362535,
      "text": "所以你刚才说的种子其实不只是钱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00188",
      "start_ms": 362870,
      "end_ms": 363185,
      "text": "对，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00189",
      "start_ms": 363710,
      "end_ms": 364525,
      "text": "钱是种子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00190",
      "start_ms": 364910,
      "end_ms": 366150,
      "text": "但真正决定这颗种子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00191",
      "start_ms": 366150,
      "end_ms": 369715,
      "text": "最后能不能长大的是一个人看问题、做选择的方式，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00192",
      "start_ms": 370090,
      "end_ms": 370850,
      "text": "我明白了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b732dc1bab9b46b2_s00193",
      "start_ms": 370890,
      "end_ms": 372365,
      "text": "明白了就慢慢学。"
    }
  ],
